{"name":"Lundeth","status":"ok","title":"Lundeth","pageId":109039,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>This article is about the village in <a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch\" title=\"Anauroch\">Anauroch</a>. For the city in <a href=\"/wiki/Thindol\" title=\"Thindol\">Thindol</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Lundeth_(Thindol)\" title=\"Lundeth (Thindol)\">Lundeth (Thindol)</a>.</i></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Lundeth\" title=\"Category:Maps of Lundeth\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Lundeth</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TEoS-p133_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TEoS-p133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Village</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sword\" title=\"The Sword\">The Sword</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch\" title=\"Anauroch\">Anauroch</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RoZK-p45-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> <a href=\"/wiki/Bedine\" title=\"Bedine\">Bedine</a><br/><a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RoZK-p45-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"allegiances\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Allegiances</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\">Zhentarim</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Lundeth</b> was a village made up of sun-fire clay huts in the desert of <a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch\" title=\"Anauroch\">Anauroch</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TEoS-p133_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TEoS-p133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lundeth?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This village scaled the steep sides of a rock <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinnacle_(geology)\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">pinnacle</a> surrounded by the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2FsdF9GbGF0cz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Salt Flats (page does not exist)\">Salt Flats</span> and had a deep water well. It was a day's ride away from the southwestern edge of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Sword\" title=\"The Sword\">the Sword</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TEoS-p133_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TEoS-p133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lundeth?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This village was once founded and inhabited by a <a href=\"/wiki/Bedine\" title=\"Bedine\">Bedine</a> tribe named the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR29sZG9yP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Goldor (page does not exist)\">Goldor</span>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Sometime prior to <a href=\"/wiki/1360_DR\" title=\"1360 DR\">1360 DR</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\">Zhentarim</a> assaulted the village with their <a href=\"/wiki/Magic\" title=\"Magic\">magical</a> prowess and seized it as a base for their western operations.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RoZK-p45-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>From then on, Zhent caravans in Anauroch would often try to find their way to this village when they ran into trouble.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RoZK-p45-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> And the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTWVsaWFsP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Melial (page does not exist)\">Melial</span>, a mixed community of <a href=\"/wiki/Hobgoblin\" title=\"Hobgoblin\">hobgoblins</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Orc\" title=\"Orc\">orcs</a>, sometimes attempted raids on the village.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EE.A-p19_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EE.A-p19-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Eventually, after many years, once the <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Road\" title=\"Black Road\">Black Road</a> was completed the Zhentarim abandoned this village.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TEoS-p133_2-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TEoS-p133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lundeth?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n\n<p>Around the 1360's <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, the inhabitants of this village were made up of members of the Zhentarim and the <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> remains of the Goldor tribe.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-7\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The latter numbered around twenty minor magelings and underpriests.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-A-p51_1-8\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A-p51-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RoZK-p45-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>After the construction of the Black Road was finished, the Zhentarim members stationed in Lundeth left. All that remained within the village were those undead remnants of the Goldor.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TEoS-p133_2-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TEoS-p133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lundeth?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lundeth?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist