 <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-4362-9\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-4362-9\">0-7869-4362-9</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-RoZK-p45-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-1\">3.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-2\">3.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-3\">3.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-RoZK-p45_3-4\">3.4</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kevin_Melka\" title=\"Kevin Melka\">Kevin Melka</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/John_Terra\" title=\"John Terra\">John Terra</a> (March 1995). “Campaign Book”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Julia_Martin\" title=\"Julia Martin\">Julia Martin</a> ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_of_Zhentil_Keep\" title=\"Ruins of Zhentil Keep\">Ruins of Zhentil Keep</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 45. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0109-8\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0109-8\">0-7869-0109-8</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-EE.A-p19-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-EE.A-p19_4-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/James_Butler\" title=\"James Butler\">James Butler</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elizabeth_T._Danforth\" title=\"Elizabeth T. Danforth\">Elizabeth T. Danforth</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jean_Rabe\" title=\"Jean Rabe\">Jean Rabe</a> (September 1994). “Anauroch”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Karen_S._Boomgarden\" title=\"Karen S. Boomgarden\">Karen S. Boomgarden</a> ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Elminster%27s_Ecologies\" title=\"Elminster's Ecologies\">Elminster's Ecologies</a></i> (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 19. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/1-5607-6917-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/1-5607-6917-3\">1-5607-6917-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260517044859\nC